# Outfit camera (R18): a folded camera drone in a chest harness: ink body, folded steel arms, accent rotors on top,
# a gimbal camera under the nose with a glowing lens, and a signal-yellow ready light (a thing the player uses).
name outfit_dronecam
grid 5
size 7 7 4
slot body Ink
slot arm Steel
slot rotor SwatchAccent
slot lens SwatchGlow
slot ready Signal
box 0 1 1 5 6 3 body
box 1 0 2 4 1 3 arm
box 1 6 2 4 7 3 arm
box 0 1 3 2 3 4 rotor
box 3 4 3 5 6 4 rotor
box 5 2 0 7 5 2 arm
box 6 3 0 7 4 1 lens
box 0 3 3 1 4 4 ready
pivot 2 3 0
